<p>This works fine. Now I want a timer counting the seconds/minutes of the progress of the song. So I put a <code>TextView</code> in the layout, get it with <code>findViewById()</code> in <code>onCreate()</code>, and put this in <code>run()</code> after <code>progress.setProgress(pos)</code>:</p>

